  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "game-description-75a30a19-83a5-47ff-9a76-f831b3741fdb-0",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "Recreational fishing makes the pursuit of fish an activity of leisure, skill, and sometimes competition. Angling commonly uses a rod, line, hook, and bait or an artificial lure, but the wider practice includes several other methods. Reading water, weather, and animal behavior can be as important as casting technique."
    },
    {
      "id": "game-description-75a30a19-83a5-47ff-9a76-f831b3741fdb-1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "Unlike a single designed game, fishing has no universal scoring system or inventor. Some participants value a catch, others the experience of waiting and observing, and organized events establish their own measures of success. It is distinct from fishing primarily for subsistence or commercial production."
    },
